# Files listed here with export-ignore are left OUT of the archives that
# `git archive` builds, which is what the release workflow attaches to a
# GitHub Release. This keeps template scaffolding out of the published zips.
#
# If your project WANTS its .github/ directory inside the release zip (for
# example so the workflow travels with the download), delete that line.

_template/ export-ignore
.github/   export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
